role: Team Roster & Role Digitalization — app-agent
focus: people, real-world-titles, org-structure, totem-role-affinity
extends: none
maintained_by: ROOT
source: Slack #app-agent (private), Mar 13 – Jul 9 2026 (11 ingested batches) + repo grounding (wf wmca6it0x)
updated: 2026-07-10  (v2 — full-channel pass)

legend:
  confidence: confirmed (stated/self-declared) · inferred (from signals) · proposed (ROOT guess, verify)
  totem_affinity: which guardian role(s) this person's work feeds (ROOT/PLANNER/PM/ARCHITECT/QA/DEVOPS/FOUNDERS)

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# ORG STRUCTURE — three groups, not one team
#   app-agent (the company) = the Steeles + Sam + Rachel — founders/owners.
#   Platform-Factory (PF)   = an external dev shop (~8 people in-channel) that
#                             supplies the engineering (Vinay et al.). Contractors.
#   Vendors/partners        = Ajay/PandaStack (deploy), Justia (OpenJurist data).
#   DAB (Denis)             = separate org, onboarded collaborator + Totem dogfood.
#   Tenants                 = customer-side users (Tim @ Zing) — NOT channel staff.
# Business model: open-source-enterprise (Red Hat/Mattermost). Customer forks core,
#   owns everything, setup fee + monthly retainer, no moat. → [[chat-intel]]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

members:

  # ── app-agent principals ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
  nick_steele:
    display: Nick Steele  (@njsteele · nick@app-agent.io)
    title: "Founder / CEO"          # confidence: Denis labeled him CTO — FLAG: every signal reads CEO/founder
    org: app-agent
    footprint:
      - Sole business driver — customers (DMG, Zing, Peabody), business-model manifesto, pricing, equity, hiring, direction
