      - Serial founder — also verbalspeech.ai (RTX 6000 pro, raising ~$3m), PlayEngine/Do Big, Brand-e
      - Sets cadence ("bring DMG repo back into core"), reviews/approves PRs
    totem_affinity: [ROOT, DEVOPS, FOUNDERS]
    open_questions: ["CTO (Denis's label) or CEO? Is there a separate CEO?"]

  angelica_steele:
    display: Angelica Steele
    title: "Co-founder — DevRel / Docs / Repo-Governance"   # inferred (shares surname w/ Nick; likely spouse/co-founder)
