anti_patterns:
  - ❌ Treating Nick's title as settled — Denis said CTO, signals say CEO (open)
  - ❌ Calling Sam an engineer — he is a non-dev product/business founder who drives via AI
  - ❌ Assuming Vinay/Ayman/Dylan are app-agent employees — they're Platform-Factory (external)
  - ❌ Counting Tim as staff — he's a customer tenant user
